The tribunal awarded the compensation in the following manner;
 Sl. Compensation  Different Heads  No. Amount  1 Loss of Dependency Rs.9,79,200/-
 2 Towards love and affection Rs.25,000/-

In the light of the foregoing discussion, the following;
 NC: 2024:KHC-K:624-DB  ORDER  (i) The appeal is allowed in part.
 (ii) The appellants as well as the claimants in MVC  No.2201/2014 are entitled to a sum of  Rs.17,42,800/- as compensation.

